，能通过数据洞察市场动态，为计划编制与调整提供决策支持；\n4.3 熟悉销售管理全流程，能够建立并优化相关制度，具备对销售目标及库存指标完成情况进行系统化考核与评价的能力；\n4.4 能够敏锐识别销售目标达成风险，及时预警，并制定有效的绩效提升或纠偏方案；\n4.5 具备出色的战略文案撰写能力与结构化表达能力，能够将复杂的业务信息转化为逻辑严谨、重点突出、具有说服力的汇报材料。\n5.语言要求：能够使用俄语/英语作为工作语言进行业务交流，并具备良好的听说读写能力。\n6.综合素质：具备良好的学习能力和主动意识，良好的沟通表达能力和亲和力，良好的职业操守；具有较强的跨团队沟通协作能力、问题解决能力和学习能力，成就动机和抗压能力强。\n7.其他：\n7.1 有海外公司或合资企业工作经历者优先，有外派至海外工作的意愿和规划者优先；\n7.2 具备数字化运营经验，擅长使用数字化/AI工具辅助运营分析者优先。","ClassificationOne":"营销类","ClassificationTwo":"重庆长安汽车股份有限公司","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-04T17:39:36","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"4bb064f4-d8ad-4e24-879d-8dfc89910835","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151135962,"PostDateInt":1770195176000,"PostDate":"2026-02-04T16:52:56","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"长线智能-智能驾驶交付总师（海外）(J26650)","